### GET All
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/

### GET 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/1

### DELETE 4
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/4

### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "newPhone",
  "code": "PH0000",
  "description": "Latest smartphone with advanced features",
  "batteryLife": 24,
  "price": 699.99
}

#### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "updatedPhone",
  "code": "PH0005",
  "description": "Updated version with improved camera",
  "batteryLife": 30,
  "price": 799.99
}